  <rules>
    <rule name="Fire and Maneuver" id="1046-71bc-6291-4abd" hidden="true">
      <description>All Units with the USA Keyword may be issued orders regardless of range from a Command Unit.


Units with the USA Keyword may receive two Orders each Round.</description>
