          <rules>
            <rule name="Rangers Lead the Way!" id="c849-31bf-6f41-f1a" hidden="false">
              <description>As a Standard Action, this Unit may Capture an Objective Marker within 3&quot; of this Unit regardless of it being Contested. If this is the first time this Objective has been Captured this Game, this Unit&apos;s HP is counted as double for the purposes of Objective Control.</description>
            </rule>
