            <rule name="Superheavy Tank Destroyer" id="d272-c584-6e54-2328" hidden="false">
              <description>This Unit may Activate as if it does not have the Cumbersome Special Rule, if it does, it may only take the Overwatch Action. When this Unit performs an Overwatch Attack Action, it may choose to allocate only a portion of the Hits from its Casemate Mounted Gun for this Attack. If you do so, that Weapon may be selected in subsequent Attack Actions this round, so long as it has Hits remaining.</description>
