          <rules>
            <rule name="Walker Expert" id="02fe-40a0-f287-3753" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Round, Walker Units within 12&quot; of Warrant Officer Jethro Madison may take the Fallback Reaction as a Free Reaction. If Warrant Officer Jethro Madison is your Field Commander, all Walker Units in your Army may do this, regardless of range.


Warrant Officer Jethro Madison may only be taken if your selected Army Specialization is AEF 21st Mobile Armor Division “Polar Bears”</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Battlefield Mechanic" id="2328-6485-7f34-6808" hidden="false">
              <description>When a Walker Unit within 6&quot; of this one is selected as the target of an Attack, that Unit may spend an Action. If it does, that Unit gains Bulwark 2 for the rest of the Round.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Warrant Officer Jethro Madison" id="a24f-7a5c-d647-76b8" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
