          <rules>
            <rule name="Old Blood and Guts" id="166c-a5c4-8d63-eccb" hidden="false">
              <description>Each Unit issued an Order by General George S. Patton may perform a Free Aim Action once per round, at any point, including their Opponent&apos;s activation. Each Unit issued an Order by General George S. Patton must take the Move and Attack Action this Round, or gain a Concussion Token.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Armored General" id="8c8b-a5da-7882-0733" hidden="false">
              <description>General George S. Patton must be your Field Commander. General George S. Patton may only be taken if your selected Army Specialization is US Army 2nd Armored Division “Hell on Wheels”.

During the Command Phase this Model issues an order to every CORE Armor Unit in your Army. This Model must be your Field Commander.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Ivory-Handled Revolvers" id="2a59-8187-dc33-5799" hidden="false">
              <description>This Model&apos;s Colt Army Revolvers may be selected for Attack Actions, even while this Model is mounted.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
