                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Virginia Military Institute Graduate" id="9350-ee25-3252-5d49" hidden="false">
                  <description>If a Unit recieves Orders from this Officer, it gains the following bonuses:
First Order: +2&quot; of Movement Value the next time this Unit performs a Movement Action. 
Second Order: +2&quot; of Movement Value the next time this Unit performs a Movement Action. This Unit ignores Rough Terrain during that Action.</description>
