              <description>If this Unit is Destroyed, all Embarked Units Disembark with no casualties.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Superheavy Transport" id="7d6e-14e6-28fa-73ad" hidden="false">
              <description>This Unit may be selected to Activate as if it does not have the Cumbersome Special Rule. If it does, it cannot take Attack Actions.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Overwhelming Assault" id="61a0-bc70-c1e7-ed3c" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Round, when a Unit that Disembarked from this Unit this Activation makes an Attack Action, the disembarked Unit may spend an Action to Call in Support. If it does, this Unit may immediately make a Free Attack Action against the same targeted Unit with one Weapon Profile.</description>
            </rule>
