            <profile name="T12-W4L33 (WALLY) Remote Demolition Mine" id="e079-b0e5-d5b9-1e62" hidden="false" typeId="d3fb-06f3-cc24-ab32" typeName="Model">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Movement Value" typeId="3e68-f430-0d7c-5747">6&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Evasion Value" typeId="c7f9-7a63-2269-6a82">7</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Armor Value" typeId="af2e-1c49-9a61-0dba">7</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Hit Points" typeId="190f-e5ac-64bb-efa8">2</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Detonate" id="d898-c36d-c01-cf8e" hidden="false">
              <description>When this Model makes an Attack with its 500lb Remote Detonation Bomb, this Model is considered to be Destroyed; resolve the Attack, then remove the Model. Instead of placing a Blast Token, consider the Model itself to be the Blast Token, If this Model is Destroyed as the result of an Attack, roll 1D10. On a 3+, immediately perform a Free Attack action with the 500lb Remote Detonation Bomb. If this Model is Destroyed as the result of a Bailout, roll 1D10, on a 6+, place the Model on the Battlefield within 3&quot; of the Transport, then perform a Free Attack action with the 500lb Remote Detonation Bomb, then remove the Model.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Independent Attache" id="6cf4-f4e7-9360-4c17" hidden="false">
              <description>This Model may not be selected as the defending Model if this Unit is targeted by an Attack.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Unleashed" id="b5de-4a63-ad4e-ffda" hidden="false">
              <description>When a Unit that this Model is Attached to Activates, it may, as a Free Action, Unleash this Model. If this Model is the only remaining Model in this Unit, it is automatically Unleashed.


When this Model is Unleashed, the following effects happen:
* this Model becomes a separate Unit and is set up within 1&quot; of the current Unit&apos;s Leader Model. The new Unit inherits no effects or tokens. 
* The new Unit Activates immediately following the current Unit, before passing to your Opponent. When this happens, it behaves as if it has the Action List associated with its Basic Type, but cannot be Ordered or take the Capture Action.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
